WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.840
It's common to visit a hanbok shop about two to three months in advance.

2
00:00:07.176 --> 00:00:17.712
Keep in mind that shops recommended by wedding planners often only receive part of your payment, since the planner takes a cut in exchange for sending many clients — an assembly-line arrangement,

3
00:00:18.048 --> 00:00:21.552
so it's hard to expect quality that matches what you pay.

4
00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:28.608
Some mass-production shops use hanbok made in China, which tends to be lower quality with subpar service.

5
00:00:28.944 --> 00:00:32.472
This is often the case with chain hanbok shops.

6
00:00:32.808 --> 00:00:38.856
If you want value for your money, look into independent shops or research carefully before choosing.

7
00:00:39.192 --> 00:00:43.800
It also helps to ask ahead, "When do new hanbok arrive?"

8
00:00:44.136 --> 00:00:51.288
This doesn't matter for custom-made hanbok, but since most are rentals, knowing when new stock arrives gives you more options.
